<div>&nbsp;</div>
</div>

<div class="informalfigure large medium-height block" style="text-align: center;"><a class="thumb" title="Electron affinity increases moving up and to the right along the periodic table." rel="internal" href="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/27884/2fec4246621a90f223d9cb4fe40e560b.jpg?revision=1"><img alt="Electron affinity increases moving up and to the right along the periodic table." class="internal default" style="width: 440px; height: 435px;" loading="lazy" width="440px" height="435px" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/27884/2fec4246621a90f223d9cb4fe40e560b.jpg?revision=1&amp;size=bestfit&amp;width=440&amp;height=435" /></a></div>

