<div class="informalfigure large medium-height block" style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</div>

<div class="figure large" id="av_1.0-ch03_s03_s02_f02">
<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="thumb" title=" " rel="internal" href="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/27885/5f219fa0e900696b2a59ce113d2a9b01.jpg?revision=1"><img alt="A periodic table of elements with each element shaded in varying shades of purple to represent differing values on a labeled gradient bar at the top." class="internal default" style="width: 640px; height: 372px;" loading="lazy" width="640px" height="372px" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/27885/5f219fa0e900696b2a59ce113d2a9b01.jpg?revision=1&amp;size=bestfit&amp;width=640&amp;height=372" /></a></p>

